Hi all,

	I am going to release 1.0.14rc1 . The "testing" packages are 
already prepared (see bellow for URL). I would like to ask volunteers to 
test compilation (only basic compilation and driver loading) of these 
packages to fix obvious packaging bugs (I'll do my testing tomorrow). 
Please, send me problems with these packages directly.
	The 1.0.14rc1 release will be available in few days, if no major 
compilation problems occur.
	This is first "wide public" pre-package testing. If everything 
goes well, I'll continue with this scheme for next package releases.

					Thanks,
						Jaroslav

URL: ftp://ftp.alsa-project.org/pub/testing

